      <VERS vnumber="5">And <gr str="7936">hired </gr>
        <gr str="3289">counsellors </gr>against them, to <gr str="6565">frustrate </gr>their <gr str="6098">purpose</gr>, all the <gr str="3117">days </gr>of <gr str="3566">Cyrus </gr>
        <gr str="4428">king </gr>of <gr str="6539">Persia</gr>, even until the <gr str="4438">reign </gr>of <gr str="1867">Darius </gr>
        <gr str="4428">king </gr>of <gr str="6539">Persia</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="6">And in the <gr str="4438">reign </gr>of <gr str="325">Ahasuerus</gr>, in the <gr str="8462">beginning </gr>of his <gr str="4438">reign</gr>, they <gr str="3789">wrote </gr>
