        <gr str="4428">king </gr>of <gr str="6539">Persia</gr>; and the <gr str="3791">writing </gr>of the <gr str="5406">letter </gr>
        <STYLE css="font-style:italic">was </STYLE>
        <gr str="3789">written </gr>in the Syrian <gr str="762">language</gr>, and <gr str="8638">interpreted </gr>in the Syrian <gr str="762">language</gr>. <DIV>
