        </DIV>
      </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="15">That <gr str="1240">search </gr>may be made in the <gr str="5609">book </gr>of the <gr str="1799">records </gr>of thy <gr str="2">fathers</gr>: so shalt thou <gr str="7912">find </gr>in the <gr str="5609">book </gr>of the <gr str="1799">records</gr>, and <gr str="3046">know </gr>that <gr str="1791">this </gr>
