        <gr str="7149">city</gr>, and <gr str="5142">hurtful </gr>to <gr str="4430">kings </gr>and <gr str="4083">provinces</gr>, and that they have <gr str="5648">moved </gr>
        <gr str="849">sedition </gr>within the <gr str="1459">same </gr>from <gr str="4481">of </gr>
